{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace/operator_cmp","title":"operator==, operator<=>(std::basic_stacktrace)","titleHtml":"operator==, operator&lt;=&gt;<small>(std::basic_stacktrace)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/operator_cmp","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"These function templates are not visible to ordinary unqualified or qualified lookup, and can only be found by argument-dependent lookup when std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator> is an associated class of the arguments.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Allocator2 <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_stacktrace<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_stacktrace<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Allocator2<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Allocator2 <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/compare/strong_ordering\"><span class=\"kw2678\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strong_ordering</span></span></a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_stacktrace<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_stacktrace<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Allocator2<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Checks if the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal, that is, they have the same number of elements and each element in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> compares equal with the element in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> at the same position.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/equal\"><span class=\"kw1585\">std::<span class=\"me2\">equal</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, lhs.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rhs.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns the relative order of the numbers of stacktrace entries in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> if they are not equal. Otherwise (if the numbers of elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal), returns the lexicographical order of the elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Equivalent to<br><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> cmp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> lhs.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> cmp <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> cmp<span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>\n<span class=\"kw1\">else</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/lexicographical_compare_three_way\"><span class=\"kw3261\">std::<span class=\"me2\">lexicographical_compare_three_way</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, lhs.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; rhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rhs.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<p>These function templates are not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when std::basic_stacktrace&lt;Allocator&gt; is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p><p>The <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, and <code>!=</code> operators are <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/operators#Comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span></span> and <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span></span> respectively.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <code>basic_stacktrace</code>s whose contents to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if the result is not <span class=\"t-lc\">std::strong_order::equal</span>, the lexicographical order of the elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Constant if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are of different size, linear in the size of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace","title":"std::basic_stacktrace"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator==, operator<=>(std::basic_stacktrace)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Checks if the contents of lhs and rhs are equal, that is, they have the same number of elements and each element in…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the contents of lhs and rhs are equal, false otherwise."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant if lhs and rhs are of different size, linear in the size of lhs otherwise."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":253,"codeBlockCount":0}
